[3617]="70024743\n1\tDeliver the broken halberds to Othran at Tyrn Lhuig in Angmar\030Collect broken halberds (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect and deliver broken halberds from the goblins surrounding Tyrn Lhuig to Othran at the bottom of the hillside outpost.\n",
